<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 613,000.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 613,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.61 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.24 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.21 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Sales		    9.31 vs   7.56</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.26 vs   1.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.16 vs   3.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.76 vs   2.94</p>
<p> Sales		   32.44 vs  29.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
